* Case 2: \(\mu_{proton}=7.26\), \(\sigma_{proton}^{2}=7.06\), \(\mu_{anti-proton}=3.13\), \(\sigma_{antiproton}^{2}=3.07\) (efficiency corrected mean and variance of proton distribution and antiproton, re 

